{"v":4,"catch":"又混亂又可愛！當你家裡有好幾隻貓時，就是會這樣。","desc":"Kittens and Yarn 是一款可愛的極簡砌圖遊戲，由你來移動砌圖，解開糾纏的冷線。\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 輕鬆。不計分、不計時、沒有壓力。按照自己的節奏砌圖，享受遊戲。\n\n- 關卡逐漸提升難度。各有特色的關卡，每個關卡的挑戰都會加入更多砌圖和冷線，逐漸提升難度。\n\n- 悅耳配樂。為提供玩家最佳體驗而特別設計的音樂和音效。","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2022-02-10","genres":["益智","冒險","策略","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0266601d7ababbbfbf49275b0c1848357d9d1d27814e75f8267c75a2ad4ca830.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d7d29e68698a8dd2d82a8e94450d19a6a1fa2a48ad928abe4251ea0021dd297.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fc6a759799f8562bc6c866bbb50f1d85eceb5761d849ebabcd4162b415dff830.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3964dd791d169debcf64573854582702aaee421b3e3e08f4d3cfac0f491c07f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a95b462ed86be94c0aeb8e826f20b37f617905825aea64e0ab00c59cfa9310c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/306cf9de6c7418dc34708afd4baad5717f82342078239b2b76a3260db7fa79ae.jpg"],"titleId":"010082c0168cc000","dlc":[]}